Overview:
This ASP.NET Web Application is designed to perform CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations for managing employee data. Built with ASP.NET Core, it offers a dynamic and efficient way to handle employee records through a user-friendly web interface.

Key Features:

Create:

Add New Employees: Form-based interface for entering new employee details, including name, position, department, and contact information.
Read:

View Employee List: Display a searchable and sortable list of all employees.
Employee Details: View detailed profiles of individual employees, including their personal and professional information.
Update:

Edit Employee Records: Modify employee information directly from the web interface, such as updating contact details or changing job roles.
Delete:

Remove Employees: Delete employee records from the system, with confirmation prompts to prevent accidental deletions.
Key Technologies:

ASP.NET Core: Provides a modern, high-performance framework for building the web application.
Entity Framework Core: Manages database interactions and CRUD operations.
Razor Pages/Blazor: Utilizes ASP.NET Core's UI components for creating dynamic web pages.
User Interface:

Responsive Design: Ensures accessibility across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.
CRUD Operations: Intuitive forms and data tables for seamless management of employee records.
Security and Validation:

Authentication: Secure access to employee management features with user authentication.
Validation: Input validation to ensure data integrity and prevent errors.
Benefits:

Efficient Management: Simplifies the process of managing employee data with a streamlined interface.
Scalability: Easily adapt and expand as your organization grows.
User-Friendly: Provides a straightforward experience for both administrators and users.
This ASP.NET Web Application provides a robust solution for CRUD operations, ensuring efficient management and smooth handling of employee records.